WEBVTT

00:06:00.807 --> 00:06:02.624
But this is a mistake.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.167
Martin Luther King Jr. explained why.

00:06:07.355 --> 00:06:11.117
Reflecting on a strike
by sanitation workers

00:06:11.141 --> 00:06:13.142
in Memphis, Tennessee,

00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:15.166
shortly before he was assassinated,

00:06:16.097 --> 00:06:17.684
King said,

00:06:17.708 --> 00:06:22.732
"The person who picks up our garbage
is, in the final analysis,

00:06:22.756 --> 00:06:25.438
as significant as the physician,

00:06:26.855 --> 00:06:29.085
for if he doesn't do his job,

00:06:29.109 --> 00:06:31.109
diseases are rampant.